  "prefLabel": "Plu 405.04 The Effect of the Signature on the Application Form for the Renewal of Business Entity Plumbing Licenses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plu 405.04 The Effect of the Signature on the Application Form for the Renewal of Business Entity Plumbing Licenses. The effect of the signature required by Plu 405.03(b)(4) shall be:\n\n(a) The signer's acknowledgement that, under RSA 641:2, I, knowingly making a false statement on the application form is a misdemeanor; and\n\n(b) The signer's certification that the information provided on the renewal application form is complete and accurate to the best of the signer's knowledge and belief.\n\nSource. #9608, eff 12-2-09",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plu100-500.html"
}
